  {
    "version": "v0.1.26",
    "name": "Sajilo v0.1.26",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-16T17:26:19Z",
    "body": "## Keeper, rebuilt\n\n- **Documents for the whole family.** Save papers for yourself or family members, and keep more than one of the same kind: two citizenships, three bluebooks.\n- **Knows what each paper does.** Citizenship and NID are kept as records. Licence, passport and insurance have expiry dates. Bluebook tax and EMIs repeat on a schedule.\n- **Photos.** Add scans or phone photos by picking, dragging or pasting. Open them in a viewer to zoom, rotate or save.\n- **Bluebook ↔ vehicle insurance.** A bluebook warns you when the vehicle has no policy, or when the policy runs out before tax is due.\n- **Custom documents** with your own fields.\n- **Reminders** for water, telephone, subscriptions, Loan EMI and more. Tick one off and a repeating reminder moves to its next date.\n- **Coming up** on the Keeper home and in Today's Up next. Notifications arrive on the day and when something is overdue.\n\n## Stocks\n\n- NEPSE updates live every minute while the market is open, in Bazar and on the Today card.\n- Gains now show in green.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- The back button goes back to the previous screen, including on Weather.\n- Stock data is now dated by the correct trading day.\n\n> Keeper data saved in earlier versions is reset once when you update.\n",
    "prerelease": false,
    "htmlUrl": "https://github.com/adarshaacharya/sajilo/releases/tag/v0.1.26",
